# --- Current folder contents (kept out of VCS on purpose) -----------------
# Design docs stay local-only for now; the build starts from a clean tree.
Project details/

# Tooling / indexer cache
.recon/

# Windows reserved device names (cannot be read or deleted normally)
# Accidentally created files named like these are undeletable via Explorer
# and must be handled with \\?\ paths — keep them out of VCS entirely.
NUL
CON
PRN
AUX
COM1
COM2
COM3
COM4
COM5
COM6
COM7
COM8
COM9
LPT1
LPT2
LPT3
LPT4
LPT5
LPT6
LPT7
LPT8
LPT9

